MOCK http GET https://crosswire.org/ftpmirror/pub/sword/masterRepoList.conf -> -2 (timeout=10000)
MOCK ftp GET ftp://ftp.crosswire.org/pub/sword/masterRepoList.conf -> 0 (timeout=10000)
